; Whispering Shallows (ow_5_3): walkable shallows around two deep pools. The four links are raft links.
; Each link has a water barrier and a paired shore post for the reed raft.
room ow_5_3
terrain Whispering Shallows: shallows (lake)
floor_color 0.14 0.22 0.22
grid
